# Italian translation for compas-player.
#
# MACHINE DRAFT: pending native review. Tone: informal "tu", short imperative
# forms as in Italian device UIs.
#
# Glossary (keep consistent; extend when adding strings):
#   Queue = Coda                    Play Next = Riproduci dopo
#   Playlist = Playlist             Library = Libreria
#   Settings = Impostazioni         Favorites = Preferiti
#   Most Played = Piu ascoltati     Shuffle = Casuale
#   Repeat = Ripeti                 Gapless = Gapless
#   Crossfade = Crossfade           Equalizer = Equalizzatore (EQ)
#   Plugin = Plugin (Plugin Store = Store dei plugin)
#   Cover / album art = Copertina   Metadata = Metadati
#   SD card = Scheda SD             Firmware Update = Aggiornamento firmware
#   On / Off = On / Off             Now Playing = In riproduzione
#   Lyrics = Testi                  Books = Libri
#   Stream Media = Streaming        Home = Home
#   Sleep = Standby                 Refresh = Aggiorna
#   Kept in English as product or technical names: Bluetooth, Wi-Fi, AirPlay,
#   DLNA, Subsonic, ReplayGain, DAC, USB, ADB, LDAC, aptX, AAC, SBC, PEQ, PIN,
#   Pre-Amp, Gapless, Crossfade, Weekly Beta, Compas Remote Control, Radio.
#   Time zone region names are translated; release labels and codec names are
#   not.
# (Accents are used in the actual msgstr values below; this comment block is
#  ASCII only.)
#
